4 Core API
**********

 -- C Function: const char * basalt_version_string (void)
     Return the null-terminated version string derived from ‘AC_INIT’ in
     ‘configure.ac’.

 -- C Function: int basalt_version_major (void)
     Return the major version component (‘BASALT_VERSION_MAJOR’).

 -- C Function: int basalt_version_minor (void)
     Return the minor version component (‘BASALT_VERSION_MINOR’).

 -- C Function: int basalt_version_patch (void)
     Return the patch version component (‘BASALT_VERSION_PATCH’).

 -- Class: basalt::Basalt_Error
     Base exception class inheriting from ‘std::runtime_error’.
     Subclasses include ‘Invalid_Argument_Error’, ‘Shape_Error’,
     ‘Dtype_Error’, ‘Device_Error’, ‘IO_Error’, and ‘Autograd_Error’.

 -- Function: void basalt::report_diagnostic (const char *FILE, const
          std::string &MESSAGE)
     Write ‘basalt: FILE: MESSAGE’ to ‘stderr’.
     ‘report_tool_diagnostic’ writes ‘PROGRAM_NAME: MESSAGE’ to
     ‘stderr’.

 -- Enum: basalt::Dtype
     Scalar data types: ‘Dtype::Float32’, ‘Dtype::Float64’,
     ‘Dtype::Float16’, ‘Dtype::BFloat16’, ‘Dtype::Int32’,
     ‘Dtype::Int64’, ‘Dtype::UInt8’, and ‘Dtype::Bool’.

 -- Function: size_t basalt::dtype_size (Dtype DTYPE)
     Return the byte width of DTYPE.  Companion helpers ‘dtype_name’,
     ‘dtype_from_name’, ‘is_floating_point’, ‘is_integral’,
     ‘promote_dtypes’, and ‘dtype_of<T>’ query and promote scalar types.

 -- Class: basalt::Device
     Represents a compute device (‘Device::cpu ()’ or ‘Device::cuda
     (index)’).

 -- Function: bool basalt::cuda_is_available (void)
     Query runtime CUDA availability, device counts, and synchronize a
     device.

 -- Class: basalt::Random_Generator
     Deterministic PCG64 random number generator wrapping
     ‘hyper_math::random_engine’.

 -- Function: void basalt::seed_everything (uint64_t SEED)
     Seed all thread-local and default deterministic random generators.


