6 Autograd Engine
*****************

 -- Class: basalt::Autograd_Node
     Reverse-mode computation graph node, edge, version-checked saved
     variable, and RAII gradient scope guards (‘No_Grad_Guard’,
     ‘Enable_Grad_Guard’).

 -- Function: void basalt::backward (const std::vector<Tensor> &OUTPUTS,
          const std::vector<Tensor> &GRAD_OUTPUTS, bool RETAIN_GRAPH,
          bool CREATE_GRAPH)
     Execute reverse-mode automatic differentiation, compute
     higher-order gradients (‘grad’), recompute activations during
     backward (‘checkpoint’), and verify analytical gradients against
     central finite differences (‘gradcheck’, ‘gradgradcheck’).


