9 Training and IO
*****************

 -- Class: basalt::data::Data_Loader
     Datasets, transforms, collate functions, POSIX ‘mmap’ binary
     reader, and deterministic multi-threaded prefetching ‘Data_Loader’.

 -- Class: basalt::amp::Grad_Scaler
     Automatic mixed-precision (‘Float16’/‘BFloat16’) scope guards and
     dynamic gradient loss scaler.

 -- Function: void basalt::io::save_checkpoint (const std::string &PATH,
          const Checkpoint &CKPT)
     Serialization functions for native checkpoints (‘.bckpt’), Hugging
     Face Safetensors (‘.safetensors’), and ONNX (‘.onnx’) models.

 -- Class: basalt::distributed::Data_Parallel
     Multi-device data-parallel wrapper executing model replicas in
     parallel and synchronizing gradients across devices.

 -- Class: basalt::Trainer
     Lightning-style training loop orchestrator supporting callbacks,
     pluggable loggers, early stopping, checkpoint resume, mixed
     precision, gradient accumulation, and multi-device ‘Data_Parallel’
     training.


