10 C API and CLI Tools
**********************

10.1 Stable C ABI (‘libbasalt-c’)
=================================

 -- C Function: const char * basalt_last_error (void)
     C ABI functions declared in ‘<basalt/basalt_c.h>’ and exported by
     ‘libbasalt-c’.

10.2 Command-Line Tools
=======================

   • ‘basalt-train’: Train a model from the command line with support
     for ‘--epochs’, ‘--batch-size’, ‘--lr’, ‘--seed’, ‘--output’,
     ‘--resume’, ‘--amp’, ‘--dry-run’, ‘--verbose’, ‘--quiet’, ‘--help’,
     and ‘--version’.
   • ‘basalt-inspect’: Inspect any ‘.bckpt’, ‘.safetensors’, or ‘.onnx’
     artifact.
   • ‘basalt-convert’: Convert model weights between ‘.bckpt’,
     ‘.safetensors’, and ‘.onnx’.


